{
  "title": "Branching Caveats & elif Order",
  "subtitle": "Top-Down Execution & Unreachable Code",
  "topic": "4.2 • CAVEATS & RULES",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      4.2 • Branch Order\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      <hlt>Order of Checks</hlt> in elif\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      Python evaluates conditional chains strictly from top to bottom. The moment ONE branch matches True, all subsequent elif/else blocks are ignored!\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #fed7aa; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Common Trap • Shadowed Conditions\n    </span>\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">Broad Conditions First</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n      If you place a broad condition (like <code>score &gt; 50</code>) above a specific one (like <code>score &gt; 90</code>), the specific one will never run!\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #111111; padding: 10px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: #f0f6fc; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n      <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># ALWAYS order from most specific to least specific:</span><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">if</span> score &gt;= <span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">90</span>:<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Grade A\"</span>)<br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">elif</span> score &gt;= <span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">50</span>:<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Grade C\"</span>)<br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">else</span>:<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Need Improvement\"</span>)\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}